# MO-002: Quantify acidity produced by requested ethanol oxidation
# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
seal v1 250mL
add v1 ethanol 0.0005mol
add v1 O2 0.001mol
react v1 alcohol-oxidation
inspect v1
titrate v1 NaOH 0.1M 0.1mL until ph 8.5 max 100
inspect v1
new
add v2 water 100mL
seal v2 250mL
add v2 ethanol 0.0005mol
add v2 O2 0.001mol
inspect v2
titrate v2 NaOH 0.1M 0.1mL until ph 8.5 max 100
inspect
